找出以下程序中的错误并改正。该程序试图统计文件"test.txt"中的字符个数。
```c
#include 
int main() {
    FILE *fp;
    long count = 0;
    fp = fopen("test.txt", "r");
    while(!feof(fp)) {
        count++;
        fgetc(fp);
    }
    printf("Char count: %ld\n", count);
    fclose(fp);
    return 0;
}
```

samples.answer:
